Subject: [PATCH] downloads: let the user fill missing HLS intervals from a
 lower rendition

Keep validated primary fragments and the chosen donor in separate caches. Align by media time, verify splice keyframes, clocks and tracks, preserve encoded packets, and verify the closed transport file before committing it. Limit media repair to the selected MissAV episode.
